      "writtenOn": "2025-03-19T23:23:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We wanted it to be explicit. It\u0027s not strictly needed.\n\nThe VM owner should know which host services it needs and if it\u0027s wrong, they find out when trying to start the VM instead of sometime later when a process tries to get a service.\n\nDo you think it\u0027s not useful to have at this point?\n\n\u003e Why can\u0027t we check the permission when the access is being made?\n\nWe also check it then too: https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Virtualization/+/3533607/4/android/virtmgr/src/aidl.rs",
      "parentUuid": "b07db8b0_8dc3fe08",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 152,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 153,
        "endChar": 26
      },
      "revId": "932edab8c1ce94df890fb7fce4c6178ed989765e",
