      "writtenOn": "2025-03-20T00:16:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi - I was thinking of this as an alternative to permissions. However, giving VM owners control over this, separate from the sepolicy is quite good. For instance, the sepolicy may allow a service for any VM, but someone writing that VM may want to restrict it furnther.",
